yo tampoco. Non plus no es «nunca más».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":12,"words":["fr-moi-non-plus"]},{"id":"fr-a2-u13-l03-e03","lesson_id":"fr-a2-u13-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Je n'aime pas le thé. — Moi ___ plus.","translation":"No me gusta el té. — A mí tampoco.","options":["non","ne","pas","aussi"]},"answer":"non","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Después de una negativa (je n'aime pas), el acuerdo es moi non plus.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["fr-moi-non-plus"]},{"id":"fr-a2-u13-l03-e04","lesson_id":"fr-a2-u13-l03","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completá la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"J'adore la musique. — Moi ___!","translation":"Me encanta la música. — ¡A mí también!","options":["aussi","non plus","pas","si"]},"answer":"aussi","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La frase es afirmativa (j'adore), así que el acuerdo es moi aussi.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["fr-moi-aussi"]},{"id":"fr-a2-u13-l03-e05","lesson_id":"fr-a2-u13-l03","position":5,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y elegí lo que oís","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Moi non plus.","options":["Moi non plus.","Moi aussi.","Moi, non.","Pas moi."]},"answer":"Moi non plus.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"En non plus la n no suena aparte: la o es nasal. La s final de plus no se pronuncia.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["fr-moi-non-plus"]},{"id":"fr-a2-u13-l03-e06","lesson_id":"fr-a2-u13-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"fr.stim.a2-u13-sortie","setting":"Léa y Hugo arreglan qué hacer el fin de semana.","speakers":[{"name":"Léa","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hugo","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.9,"lines":[{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Samedi, je vais au marché avec Julie. Tu viens avec nous?"},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"Non, merci. Moi, je n'aime pas le marché. Je préfère le cinéma."},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Moi aussi, j'adore le cinéma! Mais Julie, elle, n'aime pas les films."},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"Et ses frères?"},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Eux, ils travaillent samedi. Alors, dimanche, toi et moi?"},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"D'accord! Je ne travaille pas dimanche."},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Moi non plus. Allons-y à six heures!"}]},"question":"¿Qué prefiere Hugo?","options":["El cine","El mercado","Quedarse en casa","Ir a trabajar"]},"answer":"El cine","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Hugo dice: «Moi, je n'aime pas le marché. Je préfère le cinéma».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"fr-a2-u13-l03-e07","lesson_id":"fr-a2-u13-l03","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escuchá y respondé","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"fr.stim.a2-u13-sortie","setting":"Léa y Hugo arreglan qué hacer el fin de semana.","speakers":[{"name":"Léa","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hugo","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.9,"lines":[{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Samedi, je vais au marché avec Julie. Tu viens avec nous?"},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"Non, merci. Moi, je n'aime pas le marché. Je préfère le cinéma."},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Moi aussi, j'adore le cinéma! Mais Julie, elle, n'aime pas les films."},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"Et ses frères?"},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Eux, ils travaillent samedi. Alors, dimanche, toi et moi?"},{"speaker":"Hugo","text":"D'accord! Je ne travaille pas dimanche."},{"speaker":"Léa","text":"Moi non plus. Allons-y à six heures!"}]},"question":"¿Por qué no van los hermanos de Julie?","options":["Porque trabajan el sábado","Porque no les gusta el cine","Porque van al mercado","Porque trabajan el domingo"]},"answer":"Porque trabajan el sábado","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Léa dice: